Inspect ingestion freshness and generation lifecycle

Usage:
  eshu freshness [command]

Available Commands:
  changed-since         Summarize what changed since a prior generation or instant
  generations           Drill into scope generation lifecycle history
  service-changed-since Summarize what changed for a service since a prior service generation

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for freshness

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu freshness [command] --help" for more information about a command.
